  "description": "<p>True Frog is an Indian personal care brand specializing in hair and skin care products formulated with clean, non-toxic ingredients. Their offerings are free from sulfates, parabens, silicones, and GMOs, making them suitable for various hair types, including curly and wavy hair. <span data-state=\"closed\"></span></p>\r\n<p>The brand emphasizes transparency by listing all ingredients on their labels and avoids making exaggerated claims. Their product range includes shampoos, conditioners, hair masks, and styling products enriched with natural extracts like quinoa protein, linseed, flaxseed, chia seed, beetroot, and cornstarch. <span data-state=\"closed\"></span></p>\r\n<p>True Frog is committed to environmental responsibility, offering vegan and cruelty-free products. Their formulations are designed to be gentle yet effective, catering to the needs of individuals seeking natural and safe personal care solutions.</p>\r\n<p>For more information or to explore their product range, visit their official website: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://truefrog.in/\" rel=\"noopener\">https://truefrog.in/</a></p>",
